                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Aperion Cyberstorm is a great fast paced shooting game that should not be overlooked. When I first started the game, I admit I was not expecting much at all, seems like a generic space game. Even though that is kind of the case, Aperion Cyberstorm is filled crazy bullet mayhem to keep to occupied for hours to come. It's not perfect by any means. It can feel repetitive at times, but if your looking for a new game buy, you should definitely check this out!",
